## 9. Production Operations & Best Practices Checklist

When deploying hybrid search pipelines in enterprise production, follow these operational best practices:

- [x] **Constant $k=60$ Tuning**: Keep the RRF smoothing constant at $60$ for default workloads. Reduce $k$ to $20$ if you want top-ranked hits to carry significantly heavier weight.
- [x] **Deduplication Key Standard**: Ensure document chunk IDs match across dense and sparse vectors when upserting to Qdrant.
- [x] **Payload Trimming**: Trim large text strings before executing RRF merging in JavaScript to maintain low memory consumption in n8n execution nodes.
- [x] **Private Network VPC Setup**: Keep n8n and Qdrant deployed inside the same Vultr private VPC network (`10.13.0.0/16`) to minimize HTTP transport latencies between pipeline stages.

